msgid "The Fire Region is the smallest region of the Kingdom, but that doesn't make it the least important."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "There is a book called \"Your child, the Hero! – Prepare your child to become a Hero in 10 steps\".\nDo you want to read it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "Greetings, brave and ambitious parents!\nSure, there's no greater desire than to see one's child selected as the future Hero, right?\nOur very young children, at the age of 5, are subjected to tests of intelligence, audacity and strength.\nOnly ONE child is chosen each year, destined to become the Hero who will embark on the epic adventure on November 24 of the year of their 21st birthday.\nNow, you may be wondering: \"How can I make sure that my child is the chosen one?\". Well, the answer is simpler than you might imagine! And you've already done the first step: you bought this book!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} stops reading *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/57_house.tmx:
msgid "Are you the 64th hero?\nIt's been a while since a hero has been around here, they almost always give up before arriving here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/57_house.tmx:
msgid "I tell all my friends that I met you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "The prices for an HP UP are too high for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I would love to leave for a long journey but I don't have the strength anymore."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}}, there you are. Finally! I heard a rumor that you were coming here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "September! Long time no see! Last time was when we battled each other to be proclaimed HERO.\nWe were 5 years old."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I remember well, you got lucky that time.\nBut now it would go differently.\nI challenge you now. Show me that you are better than me.\nSee you on the north-east side of the village.\nI will wait for you there."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "W-wait a moment, September!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "How are you? Everything good? I haven't seen you for 16 years… We have so much to talk about."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I don't have time to mess around.\nSee you where I told you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "Ok… see you later."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I remembered her less surly."
msgstr ""

